 day was 4.0M shares, 0.66x the prior 10-day average of 6.1M. It never committed. The best close afterward was $24.50, within 5% of the level, and the chart ends at $21.64.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that never resolved. Price chopped around the level without committing either way. Sitting it out, or getting out flat, was a fine read."}}